# Values for `wrangler dev`. Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) and fill in.
# In production these are secrets, not vars:
#   npx wrangler secret put BRIEF_TOKEN

# Opens /brief/inbox. The inbox fails closed — with no token set it answers
# 404 to everyone, including you.
BRIEF_TOKEN=""

# Optional. Any URL that should receive a copy of a brief as it lands, so a
# submission surfaces somewhere you actually look instead of only in KV.
BRIEF_WEBHOOK=""
